\item[* task:] To form an utterance out of a sentence and to check  polarity.
Only finite sentences are accepted as utterance, (Cf. Dutch, where infinitive 
whinterrogative sentences are also accepted: {\em Wat te doen? }. If English
also wants these sentences ({\em What to do in a case like that?\/}), an extra 
mooddetermination rule must be written, for mainclause whtoinfs).
\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals)
\item[\ \ rejected alternatives:]
